Package: ROpenCV
Type: Package
Title: R Bindings for OpenCV 5
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Qing", "Zhu", email = "20170458@alu.cqu.edu.cn",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: R interface to OpenCV 5. Image matrices are exposed as a
    zero-copy cvMat class, and the function surface is generated from the
    OpenCV headers rather than hand-written.
License: GPL-2
Imports: Rcpp, graphics, grDevices
LinkingTo: Rcpp
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/Judy-ZQ/ROpenCV
BugReports: https://github.com/Judy-ZQ/ROpenCV/issues
SystemRequirements: OpenCV (>= 5.0); only required when installing from source
